setInterval(()=>{if(experience!=='portraits')return;const panel=$('#profileRoundPanel');if(!panel)return;let bar=$('#quizAtmosphere');if(!bar){bar=el('div','quiz-atmosphere');bar.id='quizAtmosphere';bar.setAttribute('aria-live','polite');panel.append(bar);}const language=(game.s.audio?.narrationLanguage||game.s.language)==='fa'?'fa':'en',now=Date.now()+remoteClock,q=quizState(game.s.fun.profileRound,now,language),event=game.s.fun.narratorActive,live=event&&event.endsAt>now&&event.kind==='comment',reaction=live?event.reaction:'thinking',key=live?event.id:q.id+':'+(q.nextIn>18?'start':q.nextIn>8?'think':'next')+':'+language;if(bar.dataset.key===key)return;bar.dataset.key=key;bar.dataset.reaction=reaction||'thinking';const symbol=reaction==='creative'?'✧':reaction==='correct'?'✦':reaction==='try-again'?'↗':reaction==='conversation'?'✧':'◈';const note=live?(event.personName+' · '+(reaction==='creative'?(language==='fa'?'قهرمانت یک ستاره گرفت!':'A new star for your hero!'):reaction==='correct'?(language==='fa'?'آفرین به دقتت!':'Well spotted!'):reaction==='try-again'?(language==='fa'?'فرصت تازه در راه است':'Another chance is coming'):(language==='fa'?'گفت‌وگو ادامه دارد':'Good to hear from you'))):quizAtmosphere(q,language,game.s.fun.profileRound?.number||0);bar.replaceChildren(el('b','',symbol),el('span','',note));if(!matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches)bar.animate([{opacity:.35,transform:'translateY(5px)'},{opacity:1,transform:'none'}],{duration:450});},500);

setInterval(()=>{if(experience!=='portraits')return;const usage=game.s.speechUsage,limited=usage?.day===new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)&&usage.characters>4800,panel=$('#profileRoundPanel');let note=$('#naturalVoiceBudgetNote');if(!limited){note?.remove();return;}if(panel&&!note){note=el('small','control-note');note.id='naturalVoiceBudgetNote';panel.append(note);}if(note)note.textContent=getLanguage()==='fa'?'گفتار عمومی با صدای طبیعی ذخیره‌شده ادامه دارد؛ خواندن اختصاصی سؤال تازه تا تجدید سهمیه محدود است.':'General replies continue with saved natural voice; new personalized question reading is limited until the allowance renews.';},1500);

function renderPhotoQuest(container,event,language,now,enabled){let stage=container.querySelector(':scope>.photo-quest-stage');if(!enabled){stage?.remove();return;}if(!stage){stage=el('section','photo-quest-stage');container.prepend(stage);}const live=event&&event.endsAt>now,key=(live?event.id:'idle')+':'+language;if(stage.dataset.event===key)return;stage.dataset.event=key;stage.replaceChildren();stage.dataset.effect=live?event.person.photoQuest.effect:'idle';stage.style.setProperty('--quest-colour',live?event.person.photoQuest.colour:'#77d8f4');stage.style.setProperty('--quest-energy',live?Math.min(8,event.person.photoQuest.level||1):1);const art=el('div','photo-quest-art'),copy=el('div','photo-quest-copy');if(live){const p=event.person,q=p.photoQuest;art.append(funPicture(p),el('i','quest-halo'));for(let i=0;i<8;i++){const spark=el('i','quest-particle');spark.style.setProperty('--i',i);art.append(spark);}copy.append(el('small','',language==='fa'?'کارتت در حال ساخته شدن است':'YOUR HERO IS TAKING SHAPE'),el('strong','',p.name),el('b','quest-choice',language==='fa'?q.labelFa:q.labelEn),el('span','quest-star-count','✦ '+q.stars+(language==='fa'?' ستارهٔ ساخت':' BUILD STARS')),el('small','',language==='fa'?'این انتخابِ توست؛ چرا این گزینه را پسندیدی؟':'Your own choice. What made you pick it?'));}else{art.append(el('b','quest-idle-symbol','✦'));copy.append(el('strong','',language==='fa'?'قهرمانِ عکس خودت را بساز':'BUILD YOUR PHOTO HERO'),el('span','',language==='fa'?'یک عدد از 1 تا 4 انتخاب کن؛ عکس تو قدرت و تزیین می‌گیرد.':'Choose 1–4. Your photo gains a power and a new look.'),el('small','',language==='fa'?'اختیاری و سرگرم‌کننده؛ این بازی شخصیت تو را قضاوت نمی‌کند.':'Just for fun. Your choices are not a personality test.'));}stage.append(art,copy);if(live&&!matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches)art.animate([{opacity:0,transform:'perspective(600px) rotateY(-65deg) scale(.8)'},{opacity:1,transform:'perspective(600px) rotateY(12deg) scale(1.05)',offset:.7},{opacity:1,transform:'none'}],{duration:900,easing:'ease-out'});}

setInterval(()=>{if(experience!=='portraits')return;for(const card of document.querySelectorAll('#funCards [data-leader-id]')){const person=game.s.fun.people.find(p=>p.id===card.dataset.leaderId),q=person?.photoQuest;card.dataset.questEffect=q?.effect||'';if(q)card.style.setProperty('--quest-accent',q.colour);else card.style.removeProperty('--quest-accent');}},700);
